        "original_id": "bafcf91e-2082-58bb-837b-5431dd4a43ef",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tessa Thompson, Phylicia Rashād, Tony Bellew, Graham McTavish, Rocky Balboa\n- Products: Creed, Rocky, Rocky II, Rocky III, Rocky IV, Rocky V, Rocky Balboa\n- Concepts: granite chin\n- Topics: Rocky film series\n\nFacts:\n- Rocky was released in 1976 as the first film in the Rocky film series.\n- Rocky II was released in 1979, Rocky III in 1982, Rocky IV in 1985, Rocky V in 1990, and Rocky Balboa in 2006 as later films in the Rocky film series.\n- Tony Bellew held the British and Commonwealth light-heavyweight titles between 2010 and 2014.\n- Creed was released in 2015 as a film in the Rocky film series.\n- Tony Bellew held the European cruiserweight title from 2015 to 2016.\n- Creed features Tessa Thompson, Phylicia Rashād, Tony Bellew, and Graham McTavish.\n- Tony Bellew held the WBC cruiserweight title from 2016 to 2017.\n- Rocky Balboa, a fictional character in the Rocky franchise, is described as epitomizing the concept of a boxer with a granite chin.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
